
---

## 3. Full File List to Upload (Directory Structure)

Create this exact folder structure locally, then drag/drop or `git add .` everything. I have **omitted** the obsolete `navigation.js` and any old PHP files, per our previous cleanups.

```text
lighton-static/
├── index.html
├── courses.html
├── results.html
├── about.html
├── contact.html
├── placement-test.html
├── placement-result.html
├── privacy.html
├── terms.html
├── .gitignore
├── README.md
├── assets/
│   ├── css/
│   │   └── main.css          (Contains your desktop+mobile nav & carousel)
│   ├── js/
│   │   ├── i18n.js           (Translations and language switching)
│   │   ├── load-components.js (Fetches nav & footer, handles active tabs)
│   │   ├── cardloader.js     (Populates courses & testimonials)
│   │   ├── placement.js      (Placement test logic & lead submission)
│   │   └── cookie-consent.js (GDPR/EU cookie banner logic)
│   ├── img/                  (All your logos, hero images, icons)
│   │   ├── logo.png
│   │   ├── hero-bg.webp
│   │   └── hero-bg-ar.webp
└── includes/
    ├── navigation.html       (Desktop navigation. No hamburger button)
    └── footer.html           (Contains the mobile bottom nav & footer content)